              listOf(
                  "\"An authored game item; concrete subclasses are content classes\"\nABSTRACT CLASS Content\n\n\"The base Terraforming Mars rules\"\nCLASS TerraformingMars : Module {\n  autoSelectWhen = HAS \"MAX 0 TerraformingMars\"\n\n  // Premise adjustments, including negative counts, run immediately after module creation.\n  This:: 2 SelectableCorporationCount\n  New@Player IF MultiplayerMode:: NextPlayer<Player, New@>*\n\n  HAS =1 GameMode, =1 MarsMap\n  HAS Class<Production>, Class<NormalCityTile>\n  HAS Class<SetupPhase>, Class<CorporationPhase>, Class<ResearchPhase>, Class<ActionPhase>\n  HAS Class<ProductionPhase>, Class<CheckGameEnd>, Class<SolarPhase>, Class<FinalGreeneryPhase>\n  HAS Class<End>, Class<VictoryPhase>\n  HAS Class<UseAction>, Class<OfferAction>\n\n  This: SellPatentsProject, PowerPlantProject, AsteroidProject, AquiferProject, GreeneryProject, CityProject\n  HAS Class<PlayProject>, Class<UseStandardProject>, Class<UseCardAction>, Class<ConvertPlants>, Class<ConvertHeat>\n\n  This: Hand, Selecting, Revealed\n  This: NoTagsFilter, RequirementFilter\n  This: EACH Class<@Tag> { TagFilter<Class<@Tag>> }\n  This: EACH @Class<GlobalParameter> { GpIncomplete<@Class> }\n  This: EACH Class<@RemoteArea> { @RemoteArea }\n  This: EACH Class<@ActionSlot> { @ActionSlot }\n\n  ModulesReady IF MAX 0 ExtendedGlobalParametersRule: StandardGpTrackRules\n\n  PayingFor<Class<BuildingTag>> IF Owed:: Accepting<Class<Steel>>\n  PayingFor<Class<SpaceTag>> IF Owed:: Accepting<Class<Titanium>>\n}\n\n\"Allows known incompatible content to coexist\"\nCLASS Unsafe : Module\n\n\"Begins the first action phase right after the corporation phase, in a game without Prelude\"\nCLASS NoPreludes : Module {\n  autoSelectWhen = HAS \"TerraformingMars, MAX 0 PreludeExpansion\"\n  premiseRequirement = HAS \"MAX 0 PreludeExpansion\"\n\n  -Baton IF MAX 0 Baton, CorporationPhase: FINALLY { ActionPhase FROM CorporationPhase }\n}\n\n\"Variant rule: each player begins with 1 of each production\"\nCLASS QuickStartVariant : Module {\n  autoSelectWhen = HAS \"TerraformingMars, MAX 0 CorporateEraExpansion\"\n\n  SetupPhase: EACH Me@Player { PROD[MC, Steel, Titanium, Plant, Energy, Heat] }\n}\n\n\"A singleton immutable provider of rule content based on game options\"\nABSTRACT CLASS Module : System {\n  autoSelectWhen = Requirement?\n  premiseRequirement = Requirement?\n\n  HAS =1 This\n}\n\n\"Signals that the complete selected Module layer is live\"\n// TODO.md: replace with BootstrapPhase entry after premise construction\nCLASS ModulesReady : Signal, System {\n  This IF MultiplayerMode:: NextPlayer<Player, Player>\n}\n\n\"Exactly one player-count Module active in a playable game\"\nABSTRACT CLASS GameMode : Module {\n  HAS =1 GameMode\n\n  \"Multiplayer rules, including the end condition that deliberately excludes Venus\"\n  CLASS MultiplayerMode {\n    HAS 2 Player\n    autoSelectWhen = HAS \"2 Player\"\n\n    HAS Class<ClaimMilestone>, Class<FundAward>\n    This: GpGameEndBarrier<Class<TemperatureStep>>, GpGameEndBarrier<Class<OxygenStep>>, GpGameEndBarrier<Class<OceanTile>>\n\n    VictoryPhase: EACH Me@Player(HAS =1 (RANK Me@Player { VictoryPoint, MC })) { Victory }\n    CheckGameEnd: FinalGreeneryPhase FROM ProductionPhase\n  }\n}\n\n\"One of the actual people or bots playing Terraforming Mars\"\nABSTRACT CLASS Player : Owner, Actor {\n  HAS =1 This\n  HAS MAX 1 NextPlayer<This, Anyone>, MAX 1 NextPlayer<Anyone, This>\n  HAS MAX 0 NextPlayer<This, This>\n  HAS MAX 1 CorporationOption<This>\n  HAS MAX 1 RoundStatus<This>\n\n  This:: StartToken<This>*\n\n  // Queued `This` work gives every Player its production floor and payment values only after the\n  // complete seat layer exists.\n  This: 5 ProdOffset<This, Class<MC>> BY Admin\n  This: 2 BaseResourceValue<This, Class<Steel>>, 3 BaseResourceValue<This, Class<Titanium>>\n\n  SetupPhase IF MAX 0 BeginnerVariant: StandardOption<This>\n  SetupPhase IF BeginnerVariant: BeginnerOption<This> OR StandardOption<This>\n  ResearchPhase: 4 ProjectCard<This, Selecting> THEN -4? ProjectCard<This, Selecting> THEN BuySelectedCards<This>\n  ActionScope<This>: LATER Admin { EACH @CardBack<This, Selecting> { -@CardBack } }\n  -Billing<This, Class<BuySelectedCards>, Action1>: \\\n    ProjectCard<This, Hand> FROM ProjectCard<This, Selecting> / ProjectCard<This, Selecting>\n}\n\n\"A player's persistent choice of starting procedure\"\nABSTRACT CLASS CorporationOption : Owned<Player>, System {\n  This IF MultiplayerMode: 20 TerraformRating\n  This IF SoloMode: 14 TerraformRating\n}\n\n\"A unit in the configured number of corporation cards offered to each player\"\nCLASS SelectableCorporationCount : System\n\n\"Records that this player chose the standard starting-card procedure\"\nCLASS StandardOption : CorporationOption {\n  This: CorporationCard / SelectableCorporationCount, \\\n    -CorporationCard / (SelectableCorporationCount - 1), \\\n    10 ProjectCard<Selecting>, -10? ProjectCard<Selecting>\n}\n\n\"One step on the terraform rating track; you generally start with 20 of them\"\nCLASS TerraformRating : Owned<Player>, Iconic {\n  ProductionPhase: 1 MC\n  End: VictoryPoint\n}\n\n\"Marks the player who takes the first turn\"\nCLASS StartToken : Owned<Player>, Iconic {\n  HAS =1 StartToken\n  TurnBasedPhase: Baton\n}\n\n\"Identifies the Player immediately after another Player in seat order\"\nCLASS NextPlayer<Previous@Owner, Next@Player> : System {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  ResearchPhase IF MultiplayerMode, StartToken<Previous@>: StartToken<Next@ FROM Previous@>*\n\n  // Continue cyclically during the action phase; otherwise stop at the start player.\n  PassBaton<Previous@> IF Baton<Previous@>, ((ActionPhase, InRound<Player>) OR (MAX 0 ActionPhase, MAX 0 StartToken<Next@>)): FINALLY { Baton<Next@ FROM Previous@> }\n  PassBaton<Previous@> IF Baton<Previous@>, ((ActionPhase, MAX 0 InRound<Player>) OR (MAX 0 ActionPhase, StartToken<Next@>)): FINALLY { -Baton<Previous@> }\n}\n\n\"The current game phase; exactly one exists from bootstrap through the terminal VictoryPhase\"\nABSTRACT CLASS Phase : System, Iconic {\n  HAS =1 Phase\n\n  CLASS BootstrapPhase\n  CLASS SetupPhase {\n    This: Generation\n    This: FINALLY { CorporationPhase FROM This }\n  }\n  CLASS CorporationPhase : TurnBasedPhase {\n    This: Photosynthesis\n    This: EACH Class<@CardWatcher> { @CardWatcher }\n\n    OfferAction IF CorporationCard<Hand>: \\\n      PlayCard<Class<CorporationCard>, Class<CardFront>, Hand>\n    OfferAction IF BeginnerCard<Hand>: \\\n      PlayCard<Class<BeginnerCard>, Class<CardFront>, Hand>\n    -ActionScope<@Player> IF Baton<@Player>: FINALLY { PassBaton<@Player> }\n    CardFront<Class<CorporationCard>>: BuySelectedCards\n    CardFront<Class<BeginnerCard>>: BuySelectedCards\n  }\n  CLASS ResearchPhase {\n    This: Generation\n    This: LATER Admin { EACH @ProjectCard<Anyone, Selecting> { -@ProjectCard } }\n    This: FINALLY { ActionPhase FROM This }\n  }\n  CLASS ActionPhase : TurnBasedPhase {\n    // A player who has already passed this generation stays out.\n    This:: EACH Me@Player { InRound* }\n\n    // The last baton is put down only after the last action has finished.\n    -Baton IF MAX 0 Baton: FINALLY { ProductionPhase FROM This }\n  }\n  CLASS ProductionPhase {\n    // The game goes on while anything prevents it from ending.\n    This IF GameEndBarrier: FINALLY { SolarPhase FROM This }\n    This IF MAX 0 GameEndBarrier: FINALLY { CheckGameEnd }\n  }\n  \"Expansions add their solar-phase work as triggers on this phase\"\n  CLASS SolarPhase {\n    This: FINALLY { ResearchPhase FROM This }\n  }\n  CLASS FinalGreeneryPhase : TurnBasedPhase {\n    OfferAction: ConvertPlants OR PassBaton\n    // Each greenery has its own action scope; the player keeps the baton until declining.\n    -ActionScope<@Player> IF Baton<@Player>: FINALLY { OfferAction<@Player> }\n    -Baton IF MAX 0 Baton: FINALLY { End FROM This }\n  }\n\n  \"Final scoring\"\n  CLASS End {\n    This: FINALLY { VictoryPhase FROM This }\n  }\n\n  \"The terminal game phase, which names the winner after final scoring has finished\"\n  CLASS VictoryPhase\n}\n\n\"A phase in which players take turns holding the baton\"\nABSTRACT CLASS TurnBasedPhase : Phase\n\n\"Requests an ",
                  "action offer; InRound or the current phase supplies its choices\"\nCLASS OfferAction : Owned<Player>, Signal, System\n\n\"Held during a table turn; transferred to the next player or removed when the phase ends\"\nCLASS Baton : Owned<Player>, System {\n  HAS MAX 1 Baton\n  This: OfferAction\n}\n\n\"An accepted action and all of its consequences, including responses by other players\"\nCLASS ActionScope<Player> : Scope, System {\n  HAS MAX 1 ActionScope\n  This:: EACH @WildTag<Player> { WildTagElection<@WildTag, This> }\n  @WildTag<Player>:: WildTagElection<@WildTag, This>\n  This: FINALLY { -This }\n}\n\n\"The option of a second ordinary action while this player holds the baton\"\nCLASS SecondAction<Baton<@Player>> : Owned<@Player>, System { HAS MAX 1 This }\n\n\"Requests that the current holder hand over the baton or finish the turn-based phase\"\nCLASS PassBaton : Owned<Player>, Signal, System\n\n\"Whether a player is still taking action-phase turns or has passed\"\nABSTRACT CLASS RoundStatus : Owned<Player>\n\n\"Lets a player take action-phase turns until they pass\"\nCLASS InRound<ActionPhase> : RoundStatus, System {\n  Baton IF 2 InRound<Player>: SecondAction\n\n  OfferAction IF MAX 0 RequiredAction: StandardAction OR Pass\n  OfferAction IF RequiredAction: DoRequiredActions OR Pass\n  -ActionScope<Me@> IF Baton, SecondAction: FINALLY { -SecondAction }\n  -ActionScope<Me@> IF Baton, MAX 0 SecondAction: FINALLY { PassBaton }\n  -SecondAction IF Baton, MAX 0 RequiredAction: StandardAction OR PassBaton\n  -SecondAction IF Baton, RequiredAction: DoRequiredActions OR PassBaton\n}\n\n\"Instead of taking an action you can gain this, and be out for the rest of the generation\"\nCLASS Pass<GenerationScope> : RoundStatus {\n  This:: -InRound*\n\n  This IF ActionPhase, Baton, MAX 0 ActionScope<Me@>: FINALLY { PassBaton }\n  Baton IF ActionPhase: PassBaton\n  -ActionScope<Me@> IF ActionPhase, Baton: FINALLY { PassBaton }\n}\n\n\"Tells what generation we're in\"\nCLASS Generation : System, Iconic {\n  This IF MAX 0 GenerationScope:: GenerationScope\n}\n\n\"The lifetime anchor for components that exist only during the current generation\"\nCLASS GenerationScope : Scope, System {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  Generation:: -This THEN This\n}\n\n\"Anything that prevents the game from ending\"\nABSTRACT CLASS GameEndBarrier\n\n\"Signals the post-production check after the final GameEndBarrier is removed\"\nCLASS CheckGameEnd : Signal, System\n",
