"UseStandardProject\": \"Use Standard Project\",\n  \"VictoryPoint\": \"victory point\",\n}\n",
          "bundles/base/payment.pets" to
              "\"A finalized quantity still owed in one standard-resource denomination\"\nCLASS Owed<@Class<StandardResource>> : Owned<Player>, Barrier, System {\n  DEFAULT +Owed<Class<MC>>\n  DEFAULT -Owed<Class<MC>>*\n  X This:: Accepting<@Class>\n}\n\n\"Identifies one aspect of a card play or purchase whose cost is being adjusted\"\nCLASS PayingFor<Class<Component>> : Owned<Player>, Signal, System\n\n\"A finalized debt; removing it signals that its denomination has been fully paid\"\nCLASS Billing<Class<Component>, ActionSlot, Class<@StandardResource>> : Owned<Player>, Barrier, System {\n  DEFAULT +Billing<Class<Component>, Action1, Class<MC>>\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  This IF MAX 0 Owed<Class<@StandardResource>>:: -This\n  // Skip the queued payment if the automatic zero-debt check already removed this bill.\n  This IF This: \\\n    (MAX 0 (Accepting(NOT Accepting<Class<@StandardResource>>) OR AcceptingFromCard): \\\n      1! Pay<Class<@StandardResource>> FROM @StandardResource / Owed<Class<@StandardResource>>) THEN -This\n}\n\nCLASS Accepting<Class<@StandardResource>> : Owned<Player>, MustCleanUp, System {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  DEFAULT +Accepting*\n  Billing<Class<Component>, Class<StandardResource>(NOT Class<@StandardResource>)> IF @StandardResource: \\\n    (X Pay<Class<@StandardResource>> FROM @StandardResource OR Ok) THEN -This\n  // Billing can itself install acceptance, so inspect empty alternatives after its automatic effects.\n  Billing<Class<Component>, Class<StandardResource>(NOT Class<@StandardResource>)> IF MAX 0 @StandardResource: -This\n  -X Billing:: -This\n}\n\n\"Records an explicit payment in units of the resource spent\"\nCLASS Pay<@Class<StandardResource>> : Owned<Player>, Signal {\n  DEFAULT +Pay<Class<MC>>\n  This:: -Owed<@Class>\n}\n\n\"Offers payment using the resource held by a specific card\"\nCLASS AcceptingFromCard<@ResourceCard<Class<@CardResource>, @Player>> : Owned<@Player>, MustCleanUp, System {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  Billing IF @CardResource<@ResourceCard>: \\\n    (X PayFromCard<@ResourceCard> FROM @CardResource<@ResourceCard> OR Ok) THEN -This\n  Billing IF MAX 0 @CardResource<@ResourceCard>: -This\n  -X Billing:: -This\n}\n\n\"Records an explicit payment from a particular card's resources\"\nCLASS PayFromCard<ResourceCard<Class<CardResource>, @Player>> : Owned<@Player>, Signal\n\n\"A card-owned adjustment that remains in play until the next project card play\"\nABSTRACT CLASS NextCardEffect<GenerationScope> : Owned<Player> {\n  PayingFor<Class<CardFront>>:: -This\n}\n\n\"A component that makes a standard resource worth one M\u20AC when paid\"\nABSTRACT CLASS ResourceValue<Class<@StandardResource>> : Owned<Player> {\n  // The resource being spent can be Steel or Titanium, but it settles the default M\u20AC debt.\n  Pay<Class<@StandardResource>>:: -Owed<Class<MC>>\n\n  \"One M\u20AC of a standard resource's ordinary payment value\"\n  CLASS BaseResourceValue\n\n  \"One M\u20AC of resource value represented separately from the component granting it\"\n  CLASS GrantedResourceValue : Cardbound\n}\n",
          "bundles/base/resources.pets" to
              "// Anything represented by a copper cube IRL\nABSTRACT CLASS Resource : Owned, Iconic {\n  \"A resource that doesn't need a card to live on\"\n  ABSTRACT CLASS StandardResource {\n    CLASS MC\n    ABSTRACT CLASS Metal {\n      CLASS Steel\n      CLASS Titanium\n    }\n    CLASS Plant\n    CLASS Energy { ProductionPhase: Heat FROM This }\n    CLASS Heat\n  }\n\n  \"A resource cube living on a compatible card, such as `Animal<Pets>`\"\n  // The explicit Owned occurrence ties the holder's owner to this resource's inherited Me.\n  ABSTRACT CLASS CardResource<ResourceHolder<Class<This>, @Owner>> : Owned<@Owner> {\n    DEFAULT +CardResource*\n\n    CLASS Microbe\n    CLASS Animal\n    CLASS Science\n    CLASS Asteroid\n    CLASS Floater\n  }\n}\n\n\"Each instance of this creates an instance of a standard resource during ProductionPhase\"\nCLASS Production<Class<@StandardResource>> : Owned, Iconic {\n  ProductionPhase: @StandardResource\n}\n\n\"TODO: consider rename to ProductionBasement\"\nCLASS ProdOffset<Class<@StandardResource>> : Owned<Player>, System {\n  This: PROD[@StandardResource] BY Admin\n  ProductionPhase: -@StandardResource\n}\n",
          "bundles/base/scoring.pets" to
              "\"Marks the winner after final scoring\"\nCLASS Victory : Owned<Player> { HAS MAX 1 This }\n\nCLASS VictoryPoint : Owned<Player>, System, Iconic\n\n\"A milestone that has been claimed\"\nABSTRACT CLASS Milestone : Content, Owned<Player>, Iconic {\n  HAS MAX 3 Milestone\n  autoSelectWhen = Requirement?\n  requirement = Requirement\n\n  This:: AllocateRequiredWildTags<Class<This>>\n  This:: (EVAL This.requirement: Ok)\n  End: 5 VictoryPoint\n}\n\n\"An award that has been funded\"\nABSTRACT CLASS Award : Content, Iconic {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  // HAS MAX 3 Award - actually it is only the FundAward standard action that can't fund a 4th award\n  metric = Metric\n\n  End: MeasureAward<This>\n}\n\n\"Places one funded award's first and second place\"\nCLASS MeasureAward<@Award> : Signal, System {\n  This: EACH Me@Player(HAS =1 (RANK Me@Player { EVAL @Award.metric })) { FirstPlace<@Award> }\n  This IF 3 Player: EACH Me@Player(HAS =2 (RANK Me@Player { EVAL @Award.metric })) { SecondPlace<@Award> }\n}\n\nCLASS FirstPlace<Award> : Owned<Player> { This: 5 VictoryPoint }\nCLASS SecondPlace<Award> : Owned<Player> { This: 2 VictoryPoint }\n\n\"A scoring Signal whose instruction is computed from a played event's printed effects\"\nCLASS ScoreEventVps<Class<CardFront>> : Owned<Player>, CustomInstruction, System\n",
          "bundles/base/solo.pets" to
              "\"Solo play with a neutral opponent and a fixed generation limit\"\nCLASS SoloMode : GameMode {\n  HAS =1 Player\n  autoSelectWhen = HAS \"=1 Player\"\n\n  HAS =1 SoloObjective\n\n  This: SoloOpponent\n  This: 14 SoloGenerationsLeft\n  Generation: -SoloGenerationsLeft\n\n  // Solo play keeps the baton until the phase ends.\n  PassBaton<@Player> IF Baton<@Player>, ActionPhase, InRound<Player>: FINALLY { OfferAction<@Player> }\n  PassBaton<@Player> IF Baton<@Player>, (MAX 0 ActionPhase OR MAX 0 InRound<Player>): FINALLY { -Baton<@Player> }\n  // Only a won solo game has final greenery and scoring.\n  Victory IF ProductionPhase: FinalGreeneryPhase FROM ProductionPhase BY Admin\n}\n\n\"Exactly one solo objective Module active in a solo game\"\nABSTRACT CLASS SoloObjective : Module {\n  HAS MAX 1 SoloObjective, =1 SoloMode\n\n  \"The original solo victory objective: complete every required global parameter\"\n  CLASS StandardSoloObjective {\n    autoSelectWhen = HAS \"SoloMode, MAX 0 SoloObjective\"\n\n    CheckGameEnd IF MAX 0 GpIncomplete: Victory<Player>\n  }\n\n  \"The solo objective is 63 terraform rating instead of completed global parameters\"\n  CLASS Tr63SoloObjective {\n    This: BufferGasProject\n\n    CheckGameEnd IF 63 TerraformRating: EACH Me@Player { Victory }\n  }\n}\n\n\"Raises terraform rating in the TR63 solo objective\"\nCLASS BufferGasProject : StandardProject {\n  cost = 16\n  1 MC / cost -> TerraformRating\n}\n\n\"One generation that must begin before a solo game may end\"\nCLASS SoloGenerationsLeft : GameEndBarrier, System\n\n\"The passive owner of the removable neutral stock in solo mode\"\nCLASS SoloOpponent : Owner, System {\n  HAS =1 This\n  This: EACH @Class<StandardResource> { SoloStandardResourceReserve<@Class> }\n  This: EACH @Class<CardResource> { SoloCardResourceReserve<@Class> }\n  SetupPhase: PlaceNeutralTiles\n}\n\n\"Creates the two independent city-and-greenery placement tasks in solo setup\"\nCLASS PlaceNeutralTiles : Signal, System, Owned<SoloOpponent> {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  This: @CityTile<> THEN GreeneryTile<LandArea(HAS Neighbor<@CityTile>)>\n  This: @CityTile<> THEN GreeneryTile<LandArea(HAS Neighbor<@CityTile>)>\n}\n\n\"Creates the neutral solo stock of each standard resource and its production\"\nCLASS SoloStandardResourceReserve<Class<@StandardResource>> : Owned<SoloOpponent>, System {\n  HAS =1 This\n  SetupPhase: 42 @StandardResource\n  SetupPhase: PROD[42 @StandardResource]\n\n  -@StandardResource BY Player: @StandardResource BY Admin\n  @StandardResource BY Player: -@StandardResource BY Admin\n  PROD[-@StandardResource] BY Player: PROD[@StandardResource] BY Admin\n  PROD[@StandardResource] BY Player: PROD[-@StandardResource] BY Admin\n}\n\n\"A neutral solo-mode holder for each kind of removable card resource\"\nCLASS SoloCardResourceReserve : ResourceHolder<Class<@CardResource>>, Owned<SoloOpponent>, System {\n  HAS =1 This\n  SetupPhase: 42 @CardResource<This>\n\n  -@CardResource<This> BY Player: @CardResource<This> BY Admin\n  @CardResource<This> BY Player: -@CardResource<This> BY Admin\n}\n",
      )
}
